                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.6363 Barco/455: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-03-04T18:00:00-05:00">March 4, 1931—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:37 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>29. Department’s telegram No. 10, February 27, 2 p.m. Barco contract signed
                    today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
